        "id": 70805,
        "name": "Gordo1981",
        "username": "Gordo1981",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/d9b06d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-13T16:54:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\nThis delay meant that ALL future Sentinels expansions will be delayed. It sort of neutralized the original intent of bringing forward Vengeance's production schedule by 6 months.\n</blockquote>\n@ketigid Not actually! What will be delayed a bit will be other, non-Sentinels products. However, the expansion schedule for SotM remains \"accelerated\" due to the Vengeance Kickstarter. The delay simply means that we won't be able to spend much time working on other properties between Vengeance and the subsequent expansion.&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Sorry I am a little late coming to the party. Does this mean that there will be a seperate Vengence kickstarter? I would like to get in on that or to participate in a pre -order, if no dedicated vengence kickstarter is run.</p>",
